      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Consumer group 1: subscribed to TOPIC \"customer-\nlogin\": read messages and performs REST request\n(once) and in the end publishes result on TOPIC\n\"login-tracking-result\" (message = customer-login\nmessage + requestResult)",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 6,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "oY9jOi-pjs9GRrkHM-wQJ",
      "originalText": "Consumer group 1: subscribed to TOPIC \"customer-login\": read messages and performs REST request (once) and in the end publishes result on TOPIC \"login-tracking-result\" (message = customer-login message + requestResult)",
